d"><div class="fact"><dt><code class="fact-type"><span class="tk-tp">T</span></code></dt><dd>the largest of <code>shapes</code></dd></div></dl></div><div class="facts"><h4 class="facts-title">Throws</h4><dl class="facts-list facts-unnamed"><div class="fact"><dt><code class="fact-type"><a class="tk-t" href="https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/25/docs/api/java.base/java/util/NoSuchElementException.html">NoSuchElementException</a></code><span class="badge" title="Unchecked; not in the throws clause">unchecked</span></dt><dd>if <code>shapes</code> is empty</dd></div></dl></div><div class="callout callout-implSpec" role="note"><span class="callout-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="16" height="16"><rect x="2.75" y="2.75" width="10.5" height="10.5" rx="2.5"></rect><path d="M5.4 8.2l1.8 1.8 3.4-3.9"></path></svg></span><div class="callout-body"><p class="callout-label">Implementation requirements</p><p>Compares with <a href="https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/25/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Comparable.html#compareTo(T)"><code>Comparable.compareTo(Object)</code></a>, keeping the first of equal shapes.</p></div></div></div></details><details class="member" data-kind="method"><summary class="member-row"><svg class="member-chevron" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="12" height="12" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 3.75 10.25 8 6 12.25" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span class="member-sig"><code class="summary-sig"><span class="tk-k">static </span><span class="tk-k">double</span> <span class="member-key">totalArea</span>(<span><span class="tk-t">Shape</span>...</span>)</code></span><span class="member-brief" data-brief="Sums the shapes' areas."></span><span class="member-marks"></span></summary><div class="member-body"><header class="member-head" id="totalArea(fixture.java.Shape...)"><h3 class="member-name"><a class="anchor" href="Geometry.html#totalArea(fixture.java.Shape...)" aria-label="Method totalArea">totalArea</a></h3><span class="member-badges"><span class="badge">static</span></span></header><div class="sig"><pre><code><span class="sig-annotation"><a class="tk-a" href="Measured.html">@Measured</a>(<span class="tk-p">precision</span> = <span class="tk-l">6</span>)
