a/javase/25/docs/api/java.base/java/io/IOException.html">IOException</a></code></dt><dd>if the text names a file that cannot be read</dd></div><div class="fact"><dt><code class="fact-type"><a class="tk-t" href="https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/25/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/IllegalStateException.html">IllegalStateException</a></code><span class="badge" title="Unchecked; not in the throws clause">unchecked</span></dt><dd>if the parser was closed</dd></div><div class="fact"><dt><code class="fact-type"><a class="tk-t" href="https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/25/docs/api/java.base/java/text/ParseException.html">ParseException</a></code></dt><dd><span class="undocumented">No description.</span></dd></div></dl></div><div class="callout callout-apiNote" role="note"><span class="callout-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="16" height="16"><circle cx="8" cy="8" r="6.25"></circle><path d="M8 4.6v3.9"></path><path d="M8 11.1v.01"></path></svg></span><div class="callout-body"><p class="callout-label">API note</p><p>The text form is not stable across releases; store shapes some other way.</p></div></div></div></details><details class="member is-deprecated" data-kind="method"><summary class="member-row"><svg class="member-chevron" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="12" height="12" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 3.75 10.25 8 6 12.25" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span class="member-sig"><code class="summary-sig"><span class="tk-k">static </span><span class="tk-k">double</span> <span class="member-key">sum</span>(<span><span class="tk-t">List</span></span>)</code></span><span class="member-brief" data-brief="Sums the areas of a list of shapes."></span><span class="member-marks"><span class="badge badge-deprecated">for removal</span></span></summary><div class="member-body"><header class="member-head" id="sum(java.util.List)"><h3 class="member-name"><a class="anchor" href="Geom