glyph" data-tone="interface" aria-hidden="true">I</span><code class="decl-sig"><span class="tk-k">public</span> <span class="tk-k">interface</span> <span class="tk-n">.Layer</span></code></a><p class="decl-summary">One layer of a canvas.</p></li></ul></li><li class="decl-item"><a class="decl" href="Shape.html" title="public sealed interface Shape extends Comparable permits Circle, Rect, Polygon"><span class="glyph" data-tone="interface" aria-hidden="true">I</span><code class="decl-sig"><span class="tk-k">public</span> <span class="tk-k">sealed</span> <span class="tk-k">interface</span> <span class="tk-n">Shape</span></code></a><p class="decl-summary">A closed plane figure.</p><ul class="decls decls-nested"><li class="decl-item"><a class="decl" href="Shape.Visitor.html" title="public interface Shape.Visitor"><span class="glyph" data-tone="interface" aria-hidden="true">I</span><code class="decl-sig"><span class="tk-k">public</span> <span class="tk-k">interface</span> <span class="tk-n">.Visitor</span></code></a><p class="decl-summary">Operations over each kind of shape.</p></li></ul></li></ul></section><section id="classes" class="section"><h2>Classes</h2><ul class="decls"><li class="decl-item"><a class="decl" href="AbstractCanvas.html" title="public abstract class AbstractCanvas implements Canvas"><span class="glyph" data-tone="class" aria-hidden="true">C</span><code class="decl-sig"><span class="tk-k">public</span> <span class="tk-k">abstract</span> <span class="tk-k">class</span> <span class="tk-n">AbstractCanvas</span></code></a><p class="decl-summary">A canvas that counts what it draws.</p></li><li class="decl-item"><a class="decl" href="Box.html" title="public class Box"><span class="glyph" data-tone="class" aria-hidden="true">C</span><code class="decl-sig"><span class="tk-k">public</span> <span class="tk-k">class</span> <span class="tk-n">Box</span></code></a><p class="decl-summary">A mutable holder for one comparable value.</p></li><li class="decl-item"><a class="decl" href="Geometry.html" title="public final class Geometry"><span class="glyph" data-tone="class" aria-hidden="true">C</span><code class="decl-sig"><span class="tk-k">public</span> <span class="tk-k">final</span> <span class="tk-k">class</span> <span class="tk-n">Geometry</span></code></a><p class="decl-summary">Operations on <a href="Shape.html"><code>shapes</code></a>.</p><ul class="decls decls-nested"><li class="decl-item"><a class="decl" href="Geometry.Legacy.html" title="public static final class Geometry.Legacy"><span class="glyph" data-tone="class" aria-hidden="true">C</span><code class="decl-sig"><span class="tk-k">public</span> <span class="tk-k">static</span> <span class="tk-k">final</span> <span class="tk-k">class</span> <span class="tk-n">.Legacy</span></code></a><p class="decl-summary">Methods from before null markings; their nullness is unspecified.</p></li></ul></li><li class="decl-item"><a class="decl" href="Polygon.html" title="public non-sealed class Polygon implements Shape"><span class="glyph" data-tone="class" aria-hidden="true">C</span><code class="decl-sig"><span class="tk-k">public</span> <span class="tk-k">non-sealed</span> <span class="tk-k">class</span> <span class="tk-n">Polygon</span></code></a><p class="decl-summary">A regular polygon.</p><ul class="decls decls-nested"><li class="decl-item"><a class="decl" href="Polygon.Builder.html" title="public static final class Polygon.Builder"><span class="glyph" data-tone="class" aria-hidden="true">C</span><code class="decl-sig"><span class="tk-k">public</span> <span class="tk-k">static</span> <span class="tk-k">final</span> <span class="tk-k">class</span> <span class="tk-n">.Builder</span></code></a><p class="decl-summary">Builds a polygon one side at a time.</p></li><li class="decl-item"><a class="decl" href="Polygon.Edge.html" title="public final class Polygon.Edge"><span class="glyph" data-tone="class" aria-hidden="true">C</span><code class="decl-sig"><span class="tk-k">public</span> <span class="tk-k">final</span> <span class="tk-k">class</span> <span class="tk-n">.Edge</span></code></a><p class="decl-summary">One edge of this polygon: an inner class, bound to its polygon.</p></li></ul></li><li class="decl-item"><a class="decl" href="Rect.html" title="public final class Rect implements Shape"><span class="glyph" data-tone="class" aria-hidden="true">C</span><code class="decl-sig"><span class="tk-k">public</span> <span class="tk-k">final</span> <span class="tk-k">class</span> <span class="tk-n">Rect</span></code></a><p class="decl-summary">An axis-aligned rectangle.</p></li></ul></section><section id="records" class="section"><h2>Records</h2><ul class="decls"><li class="decl-item"><a class="decl" href="Circle.html" title="public record Circle(double radius, String label) implements Shape"><span class="glyph" data-tone="record" aria-hidden="true">R</span><code class="decl-sig"><span class="tk-k">public</span> <span class="tk-k">record</span> <span class="tk-n">Circle</span>(…)</code></a><p class="decl-summary">A circle.</p></li></ul></section><section id="enums" class="section"><h2>Enums</h2><ul class="decls"><li class="decl-item"><a class="decl" href="Units.html" title="public enum Units"><span class="glyph" data-tone="enum" aria-hidden="true">E</span><code class="decl-sig"><span class="tk-k">public</span> <span class="tk-k">enum</span> <span class="tk-n">Units</span></code></a><p class="decl-summary">Units of length.</p></li></ul></section><section id="exceptions" class="section"><h2>Exceptions</h2><ul class="decls"><li class="decl-item"><a class="decl" href="GeometryException.html" title="public class GeometryException extends Exception"><span class="glyph" data-tone="exception" aria-hidden="true">⚡︎</span><code class="decl-sig"><span class="tk-k">public</span> <span class="tk-k">class</span> <span class="tk-n">GeometryException</span></code></a><p class="decl-summary">A shape that cannot exist, such as a triangle whose sides violate the triangle inequality.</p></li></ul></section><section id="annotations" class="section"><h2>Annotations</h2><ul class="decls"><li class="decl-item"><a class="decl" href="Measured.html" title="public @interface Measured"><span class="glyph" data-tone="annotation" aria-hidden="true">@</span><code class="decl-sig"><span class="tk-k">public</span> <span class="tk-k">@interface</span> <span class="tk-n">Measured</span></code></a><p class="decl-summary">Marks a declaration whose values are lengths, and in which unit.</p></li></ul></section></main><footer class="footer"><p><a href="index.md">This page as Markdown</a>, <a href="../../llms.txt">llms.txt</a>, <a href="../../api.json">api.json</a><span data-js-only="true">, <button type="button" class="footer-keys" data-keys-open="true" aria-keyshortcuts="?">Keyboard shortcuts</button></span></p></footer></div></body></html>
