></h3><p class="package-summary">Shapes, units and measurements: a fixture that exercises every declaration kind and documentation construct the API model represents.</p><ul class="decls"><li class="decl-item"><a class="decl" href="fixture/java/AbstractCanvas.html" title="public abstract class AbstractCanvas implements Canvas"><span class="glyph" data-tone="class" aria-hidden="true">C</span><code class="decl-sig"><span class="tk-k">public</span> <span class="tk-k">abstract</span> <span class="tk-k">class</span> <span class="tk-n">AbstractCanvas</span></code></a><p class="decl-summary">A canvas that counts what it draws.</p></li><li class="decl-item"><a class="decl" href="fixture/java/Box.html" title="public class Box"><span class="glyph" data-tone="class" aria-hidden="true">C</span><code class="decl-sig"><span class="tk-k">public</span> <span class="tk-k">class</span> <span class="tk-n">Box</span></code></a><p class="decl-summary">A mutable holder for one comparable value.</p></li><li class="decl-item"><a class="decl" href="fixture/java/Canvas.html" title="public interface Canvas"><span class="glyph" data-tone="interface" aria-hidden="true">I</span><code class="decl-sig"><span class="tk-k">public</span> <span class="tk-k">interface</span> <span class="tk-n">Canvas</span></code></a><p class="decl-summary">Somewhere to draw shapes.</p><ul class="decls decls-nested"><li class="decl-item"><a class="decl" href="fixture/java/Canvas.Layer.html" title="public interface Canvas.Layer"><span class="glyph" data-tone="interface" aria-hidden="true">I</span><code class="decl-sig"><span class="tk-k">public</span> <span class="tk-k">interface</span> <span class="tk-n">.Layer</span></code></a><p class="decl-summary">One layer of a canvas.</p></li></ul></li><li class="decl-item"><a class="decl" href="fixture/java/Circle.html" title="public record Circle(double radius, String label) implements Shape"><span class="glyph" data-tone="record" aria-hidden="true">R</span><code class="decl-sig"><span class="tk-k">public</span> <span class="tk-k">record</span> <span class="tk-n">Circle</span>(…)</code></a><p class="decl-summary">A circle.</p></li><li class="decl-item"><a class="decl" href="fixture/java/Geometry.html" title="public final class Geometry"><span class="glyph" data-tone="class" aria-hidden="true">C</span><code class="decl-sig"><span class="tk-k">public</span> <span class="tk-k">final</span> <span class="tk-k">class</span> <span class="tk-n">Geometry</span></code></a><p class="decl-summary">Operations on <a href="fixture/java/Shape.html"><code>shapes</code></a>.</p><ul class="decls decls-nested"><li class="decl-item"><a class="decl" href="fixture/java/Geometry.Legacy.html" title="public static final class Geometry.Legacy"><span class="glyph" data-tone="class" aria-hidden="true">C</span><code class="decl-sig"><span class="tk-k">public</span> <span class="tk-k">static</span> <span class="tk-k">final</span> <span class="tk-k">class</span> <span class="tk-n">.Legacy</span></code></a><p class="decl-summary">Methods from before null markings; their nullness is unspecified.</p></li></ul></li><li class="decl-item"><a class="decl" href="fixture/java/GeometryException.html" title="public class GeometryException extends Exception"><span class="glyph" data-tone="exception" aria-hidden="true">⚡︎</span><code class="decl-sig"><span class="tk-k">public</span> <span class="tk-k">class</span> <span class="tk-n">GeometryException</span></code></a><p class="decl-summary">A shape that cannot exist, such as a triangle whose sides violate the triangle inequality.</p></li><li class="decl-item"><a class="decl" href="fixture/java/Measured.html" title="public @interface Measured"><span class="glyph" data-tone="annotation" aria-hidden="true">@</span><code class="decl-sig"><span class="tk-k">public</span> <span class="tk-k">@interface</span> <span class="tk-n">Measured</span></code></a><p class="decl-summary">Marks a declaration whose values are lengths, and in which unit